hadiths[23]{hadithnumber,text}:
"141","[AI-translation] Abu Abd-ur-Rahman Al-Juhani (RA) se riwayat hai, kehte hain: Hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ke paas the ke do sawar zaahir hue. Jab aap (S) ne dono ko dekha to farmaya: ""Kindi aur Madhiji."" Yahan tak ke wo aap (S) ke paas aaye, pas wo Maddhij ke aadmi the. Farmaya: Un mein se ek aap (S) ki taraf qareeb hua taake bay'at kare. Jab usne aap (S) ka haath pakra to kaha: Aey Rasoolullah! Mujhe bataiye us shakhs ka kya haal hai jisne aap ko dekha, aap par imaan laya, aap ki tasdeeq ki aur aap ki ittaba ki? Aap (S) ne farmaya: ""Tooba uske liye."" Farmaya: Aap (S) ne uske haath par dast phera aur wo chala gaya. Phir doosra aaya yahan tak ke usne bay'at ke liye aap (S) ka haath pakra. Kaha: Aey Rasoolullah! Mujhe bataiye us shakhs ka kya haal hai jisne aap par imaan laya, tasdeeq ki aur ittaba ki magar aap ko nahi dekha? Aap (S) ne farmaya: ""Tooba uske liye, phir Tooba uske liye, phir Tooba uske liye."" Farmaya: Aap (S) ne uske haath par dast phera aur wo chala gaya. (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 17523)"
"142","[AI-translation] Abd-ur-Rahman bin Jubair bin Nufair apne waalid se riwayat karte hain, kehte hain: Hum ek roz Al-Miqdad bin Al-Aswad (RA) ke paas baithe the. Ek shakhs mere paas se guzra to usne kaha: Tooba (khushi) hai un do aankhon ke liye jinhone Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ko dekha! Wallah! Hum chahate hain ke hum wo dekh lete jo tumne dekha aur jis mein tum haazir hue usme hum bhi haazir hote. Yeh sunkar unhe gussa aaya, main hairan reh gaya, unhone to acchi hi baat kahi thi. Phir unhone uski taraf mutawajjuh ho kar farmaya: Aadmi ko kya majboor hai ke wo aisi majlis ki tamanna kare jise Allah ne usse chupa diya, jabke usko nahi maloom ke agar wo wahan haazir hota to kaisa hota? Wallah! Yaqeenan Rasoolullah (S) ki zindagi mein aise qaum haazir hue jinhe Allah ne jahannam mein unke naakon ke bal gira diya, unhon ne na aap (S) ki dawaat qabool ki aur na tasdeeq ki. Kya tum Allah ka shukar nahi karte jabke usne tumhein nikal diya, tum aise ho ke sirf apne Rab ko pehchantay ho, apne Nabi (S) ki layi hui cheez ki tasdeeq karte hue, aur tumhe dusron ke badle fitne se bacha liya gaya? Wallah! Allah ne Nabi (S) ko aise sakht haal mein bheja jaise kisi Nabi ko bhi bheja gaya, fatra (waqt-e-fatra) aur jahiliyat mein jahan wo samajhte the ke buton ki ibadat se behtar koi deen nahi. Phir aap (S) Furqan le kar aaye jisse haq aur baatil mein farq kiya gaya, aur waalid aur aulaad ke darmiyan farq kar diya, yahan tak ke ek aadmi apne waalid, aulaad aur bhai ko kafir dekhta tha, jabke Allah ne uske dil ke taale imaan ke liye khol diye the, jaanta tha ke agar wo (kafir) halak ho jaye to jahannam mein jayega, pas uski aankh qaraar nahi karti jabke wo jaanta hai ke uska mehboob jahannam mein hai. Aur yehi wo hain jin ke baare mein Allah Azz-o-Jall ne farmaya: {Jo log kehte hain: Aey hamare Rab! Humen hamari azwaj aur aulad se aankhon ki thandak ata farma.} (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 24311)"
"143","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (RA) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ne Bilal (RA) ko hukm diya, pas unhone logon mein elaan kiya ke jannat mein koi musalman nafs ke siva koi nahi daakhil hoga. (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 8076)"
"144","[AI-translation] Abu Zubair farmate hain: Maine Jabir (yani bin Abdullah) (RA) se us maqtul ke baare mein poocha jise maara gaya aur jisme Suhaim ne azaan di? Unhone kaha: Hum Hunain mein the, pas Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ne Suhaim ko hukm diya ke wo logon mein azaan de ke jannat mein koi mumin ke siva koi nahi daakhil hoga (aur ek riwayat mein hai: Aala! jannat mein koi mumin ke siva koi nahi daakhil hoga). (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 14823)"
"146","[AI-translation] (144, 145) Abu Zubair farmate hain: Maine Jabir (yani bin Abdullah) (RA) se us maqtul ke baare mein poocha jise maara gaya aur jisme Suhaim ne azaan di? Unhone kaha: Hum Hunain mein the, pas Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ne Suhaim ko hukm diya ke wo logon mein azaan de ke jannat mein koi mumin ke siva koi nahi daakhil hoga (aur ek riwayat mein hai: Aala! jannat mein koi mumin ke siva koi nahi daakhil hoga). (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 14823)"
"147","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Al-Khudri (RA) se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ""Mumin duniya mein teen hisson par hain: Wo jinhone Allah aur uske Rasool par imaan laya, phir shak nahi kiya aur apne maalon aur jaanon se Allah ki raah mein jihad kiya. Aur wo jise log apne maalon aur jaanon par amanat karte hain. Phir wo, ke jab kisi tamah par aakre, to use Allah Azz-o-Jall ki waja se chod de."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 11065)"
"148","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (RA) farmate hain: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ne farmaya: Mumin bhola kareem hai aur fajar makkar laeem hai. (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 9107)"
"149","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) se riwayat hai ke aap (S) ne farmaya: ""Allah Azz-o-Jall ne farmaya: Mere nazar mein mumin har bhalai ke darje par hai, wo mujhe hamd karta hai aur main uski jaan uske pehlu ke darmiyan se nikaal leta hoon."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 8716)"
"150","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se ek doosri sanad mein hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ne farmaya: ""Mumin apne shaitaan ko thaka deta hai jaise tum mein se koi safar mein apne oont ko thaka deta hai."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 8927)"
"151","[AI-translation] Fadala bin Ubaid (RA) farmate hain: Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi wa Aalih-e wa Sallam) ne Hajjat-ul-Wida mein farmaya: ""Kya main tumhein mumin se na khabar karoon? Wo hai jise log apne maalon aur jaanon par amanat samajhte hain. Aur musalman wo hai jis se musalman uski zubaan aur haath se mehfooz rahein. Aur mujahid wo hai jisne Allah ki ta'at mein apne nafs se jihad ki. Aur muhajir wo hai jisne khataon aur gunahon ko chod diya."" (Musnad-e-Ahmad: 24458)"
"152","[AI-translation] Musa bin Ali se riwayat hai, main ne apne waalid ko farmate hue suna: main ne Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas ko farmate hue suna: main ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Kya tum jaante ho Musalman kya hai?"" Unhon ne arz kiya: Allah aur uske Rasool behtar jaante hain. Farmaya: ""Woh shakhs jisse musalman apni zabaan aur haath se salamat rahain."" Phir farmaya: ""Kya tum jaante ho Momin kya hai?"" Unhon ne arz kiya: Allah aur uske Rasool behtar jaante hain. Farmaya: ""Woh shakhs jisse momineen apni jaanon aur maalon par aman mehsoos karein, aur muhajir woh hai jisne buraai tark ki aur us se ijtinab karta raha."" (Musnad Ahmad: 7017)"
"154","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Momin dosti karne wala hota hai, aur us mein koi khair nahi jo na dosti kare aur na us se dosti ki jaye."" (Musnad Ahmad: 9187)"
"155","[AI-translation] Abu Umamah (raziallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ne mere haath mein apna haath liya aur mujhe farmaya: ""Aye Abu Umamah! Be-shakk momineen mein se aise log hain jinka dil mere liye narm hota hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 22655)"
"156","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek shakhs Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Aye Rasoolullah! Main Quran parhta hoon magar apna dil is par samajhdaar nahi paata. Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tera dil imaan se bhara hua hai, aur yaqeenan imaan banday ko Quran se pehle diya jata hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 6604)"
"157","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (raziallahu anhu) kehte hain ke ek shakhs Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ke paas aaya aur arz kiya: Aye Rasoolullah! Main apne nafs se baat karta hoon, mujhe aasman se girna is se zyada mehboob hai ke main usay zubaan se kahta doon. Farmaya: ""Yeh sarih imaan hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 9145)"
"158","[AI-translation] (Aur unhi se ek doosri lafz mein riwayat hai) Ke arz kiya: Aye Rasoolullah! Hum apne nafs mein aisi baat paate hain jisay kehna hamari sharm hai, yahan tak ke agar hamare paas woh sab kuch bhi ho jis par sooraj tul ho. Farmaya: ""Kya tumhein aisi haalat mehsoos hoti hai?"" Unhon ne arz kiya: Haan. Farmaya: ""Yeh sarih imaan hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 9692)"
"159","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se ek aur riwayat mein Abu Hurairah (raziallahu anhu) kehte hain ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Tum mein se koi angoor ko karam na kahe, kyunke karam to musalman shakhs hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 8175)"
"160","[AI-translation] (Aur unhi se ek aur riwayat mein hai) Ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Log karam kehte hain, halanke karam to momin ka dil hai."" (Musnad Ahmad: 7256)"
"161","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin al-Aas (raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ko farmate hue suna: ""Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Momin ki misaal sone ke tukre jaisi hai, jis par uske maalik ne phoonk maari to wo na badli aur na kam hui. Qasam us Zaat ki jis ke haath mein Muhammad ki jaan hai! Momin ki misaal makhi jaisi hai, jisne paak cheez khai, paak rakh di, aur kisi shaakh par utri to na tute aur na bigaad de."" (Musnad Ahmad: 6872)"
"162","[AI-translation] Jabir bin Abdullah (raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa aalihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Momin ki misaal fasal ki bail jaisi hai, jo kabhi jhuk jati hai aur kabhi seedhi khari ho jati hai, aur kaafir ki misaal sanobar ke darakht jaisi hai (aur ek riwayat mein: sanobar ke tanay ki) jo barabar seedha khara rehta hai yahan tak ke achanak gire aur usay khabar bhi na ho."" (Musnad Ahmad: 14820)"
"163","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri (RA) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Aalihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Momin ki misal patay par bandhay ghorey ki si hai jo idhar udhar ghoomta hai phir apnay patay par lot aata hai, aur beshak momin bhi bhatakta hai phir iman ki taraf lot aata hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 11355)"
"164","[AI-translation] Abu Zar (RA) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Aalihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: Islam dhalool hai, is par sawari nahi ki jati magar dhalool ki. (Musnad Ahmad: 21616)"
"165","[AI-translation] Saad bin Abi Waqqas (RA) kehte hain: Maine Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wa Aalihi Wasallam) ko yeh farmate hue suna: Beshak iman ghareeb tha aur waisa hi lautega jaisa shuru hua. Pas us din ghareebon ke liye tuba hai jab zamaana fasid ho jaye. Aur us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein Abul Qasim ki jaan hai, beshak iman in dono masjidon ke darmiyan panah lega jis tarah saanp apne surakh mein panah leti hai. (Musnad Ahmad: 1604)"
